[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6002.149, "timestamp": "01:40:02", "text": "是的。我只希望尽快出道，并且在我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6004.31, "timestamp": "01:40:04", "text": "首次直播的时候我好紧张。我当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6007.03, "timestamp": "01:40:07", "text": "比如因为睡眠不足而无法正常睡眠"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6009.03, "timestamp": "01:40:09", "text": "当时就像惊慌失措一样。我的天啊，这该怎么办？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6012.229, "timestamp": "01:40:12", "text": "直播继续吗？我的天哪，时间到了。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6015.27, "timestamp": "01:40:15", "text": "我当时特别焦虑，但我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6017.35, "timestamp": "01:40:17", "text": "我觉得是我干的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6019.51, "timestamp": "01:40:19", "text": "是的，对每个人来说都非常难忘。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6022.75, "timestamp": "01:40:22", "text": "感觉。是的。你真的做到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6025.31, "timestamp": "01:40:25", "text": "出色地。真是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6028.31, "timestamp": "01:40:28", "text": "很有趣，我很高兴你做了这件事。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6030.87, "timestamp": "01:40:30", "text": "为你感到骄傲。那真是太有趣了。感谢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6037.27, "timestamp": "01:40:37", "text": "或许你的首秀就激励了很多人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6039.35, "timestamp": "01:40:39", "text": "还有很多人。那真是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6042.95, "timestamp": "01:40:42", "text": "好的。你也激励了我。感谢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6045.91, "timestamp": "01:40:45", "text": "你。真是太好了。非常好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6048.629, "timestamp": "01:40:48", "text": "听到别人说我激励了别人，我感到非常高兴。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6050.79, "timestamp": "01:40:50", "text": "我以为我永远也做不到。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6053.75, "timestamp": "01:40:53", "text": "那。是的。感觉好像有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6056.47, "timestamp": "01:40:56", "text": "那些最初因为观看视频而开始做 YouTube 的人"}]